<title>USA: H&amp;R Block unit completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>H&amp;R Block unit completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>H&amp;R Block Inc unit Block Financial Corp said Tuesday it completed the acquisition of Option One Mortgage Corp from Fleet Financial Group Inc .</p>
<p>Option One is an originator of sub-prime mortgage loans with more than $1 billion in originations last year.</p>
<p>H&amp;R Block offers tax, financial and information services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
